2.The above unaudited consolidated financial results are prepared to comply in all material respect in accordance with Indian Accounting Standard (Ind AS) notified under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013, read with relevant rules issued there under. These unaudited consolidated financial results were reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on August 10, 2026. These results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 have been subject to limited review by the Statutory Auditors of the Company who has issued an unmodified review report thereon. &lt;br /&gt; 
